# Integer16 multiplication within range

Verifies int16 multiplication with operands chosen to stay inside the 16-bit
range through the complete CLI pipeline.

>>> source
left: int16 = 200
right: int16 = 150
neg_left: int16 = -200

// Verifies multiplication of two positive operands.
pos_product: int16 = left * right
print(pos_product)

// Verifies multiplication with opposite signs.
mixed_product: int16 = neg_left * right
print(mixed_product)

<<< stdout
30000
-30000

<<< stderr
